WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.950
In Manage hosting, open SSL.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.645
Find the domain marked Not secure.

3
00:00:07.645 --> 00:00:10.018
Keep Include www ticked.

4
00:00:10.068 --> 00:00:18.018
Click Issue free SSL, and wait a few seconds.

5
00:00:18.068 --> 00:00:21.191
The domain now shows Secure, with its expiry date.

6
00:00:21.191 --> 00:00:24.748
And it renews automatically.
